{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/770a4356b23a15631b6b7c5a00b4439d.webp?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><strong>Abyss Looters is a dungeon-crawling adventure set in a fantasy world, featuring co-op gameplay for 1-4 players, from a solo developer.</strong><br><br>Explore dungeons with friends, avoid traps, battle monsters, collect artifacts, create your own guild of adventurers, and become a legendary hero!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7175eb353b6d3c4bab77d04b57845703.poster.avif?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7175eb353b6d3c4bab77d04b57845703.webm?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7175eb353b6d3c4bab77d04b57845703.mp4?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll encounter numerous procedurally generated dungeons of the <strong>Abyss</strong> with varying levels of difficulty. The higher the difficulty, the scarier the monsters, the more dangerous the traps, and the greater the rewards.<br><br>Choose the character class you like (more will be added in the future).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/edab80dd5caedf0dcbbfb44366da6dcc.poster.avif?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/edab80dd5caedf0dcbbfb44366da6dcc.webm?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/edab80dd5caedf0dcbbfb44366da6dcc.mp4?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Feel like a true adventurer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7f8e4dafc620242ca190b4f4164e177a.poster.avif?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7f8e4dafc620242ca190b4f4164e177a.webm?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/7f8e4dafc620242ca190b4f4164e177a.mp4?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/06ab7f42bfae8c03f4eaf407c5a4076e.webp?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different character classes, each with unique features<br></li><li>Randomly generated dungeons<br></li><li>Great verticality in level design<br></li><li>Lots of secrets<br></li><li>Awesome platforming<br></li><li>Various mechanisms<br></li><li>Numerous different treasures<br></li><li>Diverse monsters<br></li><li> Guild hall customization</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/955c2a4809a07b0d93a3ad6550af13db.poster.avif?t=1727803416\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/955c2a4809a07b0d93a3ad6550af13db.webm?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955700/extras/955c2a4809a07b0d93a3ad6550af13db.mp4?t=1727803416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vide